 "intro_zh": "丹霞山是世界地质公园、世界自然遗产、国家级风景名胜区、国家地质公园。丹霞山以“丹霞地貌”命名，在全世界已发现的1200多处丹霞地貌中，丹霞山是发育最典型、类型最齐全、造型最丰富、景色最优美的丹霞地貌之一。",
 "intro_en": "Mount Danxia (Chinese: 丹霞山; pinyin: Dānxiá Shān) is a noted scenic mountainous area in Renhua County, in the northern part of Guangdong province. It is described on the local signage as a \"world famous UNESCO geopark of China\". It was inscribed as part of the China Danxia World Heritage Site in 2010 because of its unique geographical in formations and spectacular scenery. It is also an AAAAA Chinese attraction.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
